{
    "background_story": "Saige was a skilled and fearless matadora from a small town in Spain. Growing up, she was fascinated by the art of bullfighting and spent countless hours training with her abuelo, a renowned torero. Saige's specialty was the banderilla, a decorative barbed stick used to test the bull's ferocity. With a flick of her wrist and a flash of her sequined costume, she could precision-place the banderilla in the bull's shoulder, showcasing her bravery and finesse. Saige's performances in the ring were met with thunderous applause, earning her the nickname 'La Estrella de la Banderilla' (The Star of the Banderilla). As she danced around the bull, her movements were a testament to her skill, strength, and artistry, leaving a lasting impression on all who witnessed her in action.",
